      "role": "assistant",
      "format": "markdown",
      "text": "The built Node server does listen on 43128, but `/` never returns 200; that narrows the failure to SSR request handling, not startup. The likely production-only fault is the database schema being read by a filesystem URL after Nitro relocates bundled server modules. I’m replacing that fragile runtime path with Vite’s bundled raw-SQL import, then rebuilding and rerunning the same HTML-plus-API smoke test."
    }
  ],
